LicenseID: LicenseRef-west-ncs-sbom-picolibc-runtime
LicenseName: picolibc runtime archives bundled license notice
ExtractedText: <text>The picolibc runtime archives are built from a collection of source files
that carry multiple licenses and notices.

The upstream picolibc distribution ships a machine-readable copyright and
license manifest in COPYING.picolibc, and it also ships COPYING.NEWLIB for
the newlib-derived portions of the source tree.

For Zephyr SDK toolchains that bundle picolibc, the applicable notice files
are:
- share/licenses/picolibc/COPYING.NEWLIB
- share/licenses/picolibc/COPYING.picolibc

This LicenseRef represents that bundled multi-license notice set for the
toolchain runtime archives libc.a and libm.a from the picolibc directory.
</text>
